; c03-double-ahead-forces-count. Anchor: shot-0042 (Ch. 3).
; Printed: 0.53.
; Claim: leading the double-deuce before a deuce-blank off brings the
;   deuce-trey down on the double. Our reading: the partner, holding it,
;   gives it; an opponent gives it only when it is his one deuce.
; State: the bidder holds 2-2 and 2-0, and four deuces are out of his hand
;   and not trump (the reading needs one deuce held or trump, else five are
;   out and the book model gives 113/243); nothing played; the 21 others
;   dealt uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 467/855. Book model: 43/81.
(query
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (partner v p)
    (holds p 3-2))
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (holds x 3-2)
    (none (roles d) (in d q2) (not (tile d 3-2)) (holds x d))))
